n- **Where it lives:** `GET /` is handled by `HomePageController.java:29-34` and renders `templates/home/index.pug`. The page title is set at `HomePageController.java:31` and rendered through `layout.pug:7`. Both \"Browse Products\" and \"Shop Now\" link to `/products`, whose heading is \"Our Products\" (`catalog.pug:9`).\n- **Existing tests:** no test anywhere opens `/`. The catalogue heading has its own test, `ProductCatalogPageIntegrationTest.pageIsTitledHeadedAndPlacedAsTheCatalogue`, but it doesn't start from the home page.\n- **Test levels:** the happy path `home-page-welcomes-the-visitor` gets a Playwright browser test (`test-e2e`). The other six scenarios get MockMvc integration tests (`test-integration`), following `ProductCatalogPageIntegrationTest`. None needs to run in a browser only.\n- **Context:** `portal`. The designed and generated context maps agree on it (Separate Ways, no edges), and \"HomePage\" is already in the portal glossary. The plan proposes no new glossary terms.\n- **Open assumptions:**\n  - The heading text reads \"Welcome to domaincentric.commerce\" because Pug adds no space between the text and the `.commerce` span. Nothing rendered the page, so this is unconfirmed.\n  - The \"section below the heading\" in the View Cart scenario is taken to be the hero's `.hero__actions` block.","ttft_ms":2961,"type":"result","duration_ms":91024,"uuid":"ad88d105-95a5-46b9-882d-64f5a35ba334","ttft_stream_ms":2059,"time_to_request_ms":48,"first_content_frame_ms":2059,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
